  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OperatorFlavor
  labelEn: Window
  labelPt: Janela
  linesEn:
  - This thing is completely sealed.
  - Welded from the outside.
  - Not even light gets through.
  - ...someone didn't want me to see where I am.
  linesPt:
  - "Isso aqui est\xE1 completamente selado."
  - Soldada por fora.
  - Nem a luz passa.
  - "...algu\xE9m n\xE3o queria que eu visse onde estou."
  sound: 19
  motion: 2
  asThought: 1
