  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WaterCooler
  labelEn: Use
  labelPt: Usar
  audioSource: {fileID: 442239557}
  sipDelay: 1.3
  thoughtsEn:
  - Warm. Tastes like plastic.
  - At least the water is real.
  - The jug is almost empty. Who changes it?
  - ...better than nothing.
  thoughtsPt:
  - "Morna. Gosto de pl\xE1stico."
  - "Pelo menos a \xE1gua \xE9 de verdade."
  - "O gal\xE3o t\xE1 quase vazio. Quem troca isso?"
  - ...melhor que nada.
